     "*   **SVO Node:** Stored in a flat array or buffer.",
     "A 32-bit integer where the MSB (bit 31) indicates a solid leaf.",
     "*   Perform a ray-AABB slab test against world bounds.",
     "*   Compute intersection of the ray with the root box.",
     "*   Clamp $t_{entry}$ to 0.0 if negative to handle rays starting inside the volume.",
     "*   **Child Selection:** Determine the child index intersected by the ray at the current entry point.",
     "*   **Leaf Check:** If the child is a leaf (`getLeafMask > 0`) and valid, and the ray intersects it ($t_{entry} \\ge 0$), a hit is found.",
     "*   **Time Complexity:** $O(\\log N)$ on average for sparse scenes, where $N$ is the number of voxels, as it skips empty space.",
     "*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$ for storing the SVO structure, where $N$ is the number of nodes."
    ]
   }
